  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "asset_id": "summer_50dc46bdf1e70213",
      "duration": 0.45,
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "background"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "加工坊的门在身后合上，夜已经很深了。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "summer_be6ef41ba62a73cd",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": null,
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "left",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "……什么都没有查到呢。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "订单就是这样。工整，干净，除了订购人是谁没有明确写出来，从原材料到成品，和红叶镇加工坊出品的任何一批立柱和枫木板都没什么区别。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "这工坊也真的是，连订单是谁下的都没写清楚，也照做。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "你看着绯恩的脸。奔波了一天，她看起来有些疲乏。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "不知是出于责任还是别的什么原因，她竟然对一座离奇的舞台那么上心。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "就在这时，风里传来了声音。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "又来了！每天晚上都是这个声音……到底是从哪儿传出来的啊！",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "你站住不动。风从镇子外面吹进来——声音第一次有了方向。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "……那边。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "诶？那个方向，出了镇子就全是林子了啊？",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "你迈开步子。她在原地站了两秒，然后小跑着跟了上来。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "",
      "duration": 0.45,
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "background"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "路越走越窄，红叶在脚底下沙沙地响。歌声越来越清楚，已经能听出词了。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "summer_7ef30617585dbadd",
      "duration": 0.45,
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "background"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "……你不觉得，这个时间，这个方向，有点吓人吗。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "绯恩紧紧地拽住了你的袖子。女孩的脸上流露着复杂的表情，哪怕这红枫林她来过无数次，紧张仍然多过了疲惫。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "我是说，万一是什么野兽——",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "……算了。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "她嘴上说着算了，抓着你袖子的手一直没松。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": null,
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "left",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": false
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "summer_ebdda7c9f438633a",
      "duration": 0.45,
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "background"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "林子到了尽头，有水声。不是流水的声音，是水在轻轻地荡。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "先看见的是水面的光——月亮被揉碎了，浮在整片水面上。然后是倒影。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "有人站在水里，手里握着一支麦克风。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "summer_9cd4265c20601ef2",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": {
        "offset_x": -0.05,
        "offset_y": 0.2,
        "scale": 1.23
      },
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "center",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "她背着身，一边唱，一边用手比划着拍子。那动作不像舞台的演出，倒像在数一车矿装了多久。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "（……原来是你。）",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "顾祇",
      "text": "站那么远，听得清吗。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": null,
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "center",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": false
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "summer_5ecd20b2ead465e6",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": {
        "offset_x": 0.0,
        "offset_y": 0.2,
        "scale": 1.24
      },
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "center",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "看不见那身黑裙，也看不见那把比人还高的镐。水里的人单薄得晃眼，胳膊和腿都露在外面。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "！",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "……",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": null,
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "center",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": false
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "summer_5ecd20b2ead465e6",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": null,
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "right",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "summer_be6ef41ba62a73cd",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": null,
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "left",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "港口那座舞台……是不是你搭的！",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "顾祇",
      "text": "哦，那个啊。搭得还行吧？",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "还、还行？！",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "顾祇",
      "text": "备了一个星期的材料，昨晚搭了四个小时。枫木板压了两天才上的架，不压的话，一踩就响。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "不、不是这个问题吧！",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "那你为什么非要在晚上唱啊！",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "顾祇",
      "text": "因为白天我要挖矿啊。立柱的赤铜都是我亲自搞的，不然岂不是对不上账？",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "（……立柱的赤铜。）",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "你、你到底想干什么啊！",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "顾祇把麦克风收进袋子，弯腰拎起放在岸边的鞋。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "顾祇",
      "text": "我的大小姐，你们大半夜两个人偷偷跑来这红枫林，总不会真的是来关心我想做什么的吧。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "！！！",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "summer_da73c7805cc58a31",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": null,
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "left",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "你……你在胡说些什么……什么啊……",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "顾祇",
      "text": "回去了。明天还要上工。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "顾祇",
      "text": "两个人在晚上，要当心哦~",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": null,
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "right",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": false
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": null,
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "left",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": false
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "summer_09dac7c15c736f62",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": {
        "offset_x": -0.04,
        "offset_y": 0.2,
        "scale": 1.23
      },
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "center",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "我——",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "……算了。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "她走了，像一缕流动的月光。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "（……她刚才想说什么啊。）",
      "type": "dialogue"
    }
  ]
}
